{"id":203475,"contentId":690585,"name":"日鞠（临战）","avatarRemote":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_404/h_456/829/191981/2026/0/20/616820.png","aliases":["阳葵","ヒマリ","otto","轮椅","Himari","摩鞠","武装"],"summary":"日鞠（临战）是千年科学学园特异现象搜查部的3星T.S角色，攻击类型为贯通、防御类型为弹力装甲，屋内适应性为S。她可消耗3 COST召唤“室外用轮椅”，持续30秒，为范围友方回复生命值，并对高生命值敌人造成伤害；敌人为重装甲时，还会提高其受到的克制伤害。轮椅每7秒提升友方贯通克制率，日鞠自身技能可增加暴击伤害与友方COST恢复力。","updatedAt":1787912405,"rarity":3,"tacticImage":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_160/h_40/829/72324/2025/5/13/865239.png","tactic":"SPECIAL","school":"千年科学学园","schoolIcon":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_43/h_32/829/103682/2025/6/1/308474.png","club":"特异现象搜查部","releaseDate":"2026/1/20","role":"支援","roleIcon":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_43/h_32/829/191981/2025/9/20/153009.png","attack":"贯通","attackIcon":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_43/h_32/829/191981/2025/9/20/583414.png","defense":"弹力装甲","defenseIcon":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_43/h_32/829/191981/2025/9/20/478786.png","positionImage":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_210/h_55/829/43637/2025/4/26/219503.png","position":"BACK","terrain":{"urban":"B","outdoor":"D","indoor":"S"},"weaponType":"","weaponIcon":"","equipment":["鞋子","发卡","项链"],"portraits":[{"name":"默认","url":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_1389/829/399789/2026/0/18/817528.png"},{"name":"室外用轮椅","url":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2696/h_2280/829/191981/2026/0/20/453020.png"}],"hall":{"image":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1500/h_1000/829/191981/2026/0/20/199523.png"},"bgm":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_0/h_0/829/191981/2026/1/14/400607.ogg","skills":[{"kindLabel":"EX技能","name":"这是室外用的轮椅哦","icon":"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_109/h_96/829/191981/2026/0/21/232728.png","levels":[{"lv":1,"text":"日鞠（临战）搭载「室外用轮椅」登场。\n「室外用轮椅」额外拥有日鞠（临战）最大生命值10.7%的生命值（持续30秒）\n并以选中施放的对象为中心，对圆形范围内的友方赋予治愈力4.6%的生命值回